      <a class="brand support-brand" href="/" aria-label="Kidz Quest home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/images/logo.png" alt="Kidz Quest" /></a>
      <h1 class="support-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p>These terms describe use of the Kidz Quest registration service and its optional text messaging program.</p>

      <h2>Registration and pickup</h2>
      <p>Please register only children you are authorized to register and provide accurate information. Review any prefilled details and update them as needed. Keep your child's pickup code private and follow the event staff's pickup procedures. A pickup code alone should not be relied on as proof of identity.</p>

      <h2>Optional text messages</h2>
      <p>If you opt in using the registration form, Kidz Quest may send you registration codes, pickup reminders and messages from staff at the number you provide. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Consent to receive texts is optional and is not required to register a child.</p>
      <p>To stop texts, reply STOP to a Kidz Quest message. For help, reply HELP or speak with Kidz Quest event staff. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Text delivery is not guaranteed; please keep a screenshot or written copy of your pickup code.</p>

      <h2>Responsible use</h2>
      <p>Please do not interfere with the service or access or use another family's information without authorization. The service may be unavailable or changed from time to time. Contact event staff if you need help with registration or pickup.</p>

      <h2>Privacy and contact</h2>
      <p>Read our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> to learn how registration and messaging information is handled. For questions about these terms or the messaging program, speak with Kidz Quest event staff. Updated terms will be posted on this page.</p>
      <nav class="policy-nav" aria-label="Policy navigation"><a href="/">← Back to registration</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></nav>
